al reliability threshold or the invalid early-stage interpretation.","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]},{"gold_issue_id":"2602.06021:I004","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-003","focus_relation":"different_causal_subject","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2602.06021:I004:U001","2602.06021:I004:U002","2602.06021:I004:U005"],"prediction_causal_unit_ids":["ISSUE-003:U001","ISSUE-003:U009","ISSUE-003:U013"],"same_causal_subject":false,"same_failed_obligation":false,"same_failure_operation":false,"identity_explanation":"The gold issue is that the numerical estimator accepts normal-score zeros without the defining negative-curvature condition. ISSUE-003 addresses reach and tube regularity, not certification that a projected candidate satisfies the ridge curvature criterion.","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]},{"gold_issue_id":"2602.06021:I005","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-003","focus_relation":"different_operation_step_or_formula","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2602.06021:I005:U001","2602.06021:I005:U002","2602.06021:I005:U005"],"prediction_causal_unit_ids":["ISSUE-003:U003","ISSUE-003:U005","ISSUE-003:U014"],"same_causal_subject":false,"same_failed_obligation":false,"same_failure_operation":false,"identity_explanation":"The gold issue is the omitted derivative of the eigenvector field in the Jacobian of F and the resulting invalid Hessian-only Newton step. ISSUE-003 concerns a global third-derivative/reach estimate and does not identify the product-rule omission or Newton formula failure.","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]},{"gold_issue_id":"2602.06021:I006","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-002","focus_relation":"different_operation_step_or_formula","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2602.06021:I006:U001","2602.06021:I006:U002","2602.06021:I006:U004"],"prediction_causal_unit_ids":["ISSUE-002:U001","ISSUE-002:U004","ISSUE-002:U009"],"same_causal_subject":false,"same_failed_obligation":false,"same_failure_operation":false,"identity_explanation":"The gold issue is undefined or ill-conditioned application of the spectral inverse at unrestricted estimator inputs. ISSUE-002 concerns a gradient-descent step-size contraction condition and does not recognize the missing eigenvalue safeguard or regularized inverse.","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]}],"audit":{"all_gold_ids_decided":true,"all_ranked_candidates_considered":true,"target_type_not_used_for_identity":true,"severity_not_used_for_identity":true,"prediction_reuse_requires_explicit_issue_support":true,"each_gold_credited_at_most_once":true,"combined_entries_are_self_contained_diagnoses":true,"support_limit_three_respected":true}}